# PROJECT README HEHE

## Installation

### Clone the repository
```
git clone [URL]
```

### Create a virtual environment
```
conda create -n [myenv]
conda activate [myenv]
```

### Install the packge
```
cd cdd209-final-template
pip install .
```

## Usage

## Testing
After installation, in repo folder type:

```
pytest
